    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1789130/extras/d63ef3e7d0d1c9cdda00a967a7c5101c.avif?t=1725179197\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1789130/extras/6d68bdb362d1dec74469ce602f557219.avif?t=1725179197\" /></div><br><br>[Story]<br>He wasn't very popular with the ladies...<br>But he had a special power...<br><br>He can see monsters that<br>others can't!<br><br>With supernatural events happening around town,<br>he decides to use his abilities to find the monsters in hiding...!<br><br><br>[Game system]<br>Taking out the Evil Spirits<br>Take out the 60+ Evil Spirits lurking around the world!<br>Fight them using an orthodox turn-based fighting system.<br><br>Monsters<br>- Nekomata<br>- Ittan-momen<br>- Water Imp<br>and many more!<br>Try to find them all!<br>Use special items at certain fights to unlock hidden events...!",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1789130/extras/d63ef3e7d0d1c9cdda00a967a7c5101c.avif?t=1725179197\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1789130/extras/6d68bdb362d1dec74469ce602f557219.avif?t=1725179197\" /></div><br><br>[Story]<br>He wasn't very popular with the ladies...<br>But he had a special power...<br><br>He can see monsters that<br>others can't!<br><br>With supernatural events happening around town,<br>he decides to use his abilities to find the monsters in hiding...!<br><br><br>[Game system]<br>Taking out the Evil Spirits<br>Take out the 60+ Evil Spirits lurking around the world!<br>Fight them using an orthodox turn-based fighting system.<br><br>Monsters<br>- Nekomata<br>- Ittan-momen<br>- Water Imp<br>and many more!<br>Try to find them all!<br>Use special items at certain fights to unlock hidden events...!",
